@baseUrl = http://localhost:5253

### Daftar akun
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Budi", "email": "budi@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd1" }

### Kirim laporan (Basic base64 dari budi@example.com:Passw0rd1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YnVkaUBleGFtcGxlLmNvbTpQYXNzdzByZDE=

